<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria February monthly inflation  is 242.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria February monthly inflation  is 242.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's monthly inflation in February soared to 242.7 percent from 43.5 percent in January, an official of the National Statistics Institue said on Monday.</p>
</text>
